{"asset_key":"mn2/herohub_story_10412130","episode":"mn2","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10412130","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1041213001:1":{"text":"ユグドラシルはとっても不思議ですね。いつの間にか気持ちを落ち着かせてくれます。","source_cn":"薄暮丛林好神奇呀，能在让人不知不觉间获得平静。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD584DFE5CAD1BC1B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041213002:1":{"text":"神の祝福を受けた穏やかな場所のようにも思えますね。","source_cn":"感觉也是个受到神明祝福的祥和地方呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x33EA38F9A5A04A26","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041213003:1":{"text":"本当に？ロンロンには全然分からないや！","source_cn":"真的吗？可满满完全感觉不到！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x543E6CF90CDA9815","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041213004:1":{"text":"……あなたはメイジでもないもの！","source_cn":"……你又不是魔法师！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE02B04C9C2200C95","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"メイメイ","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"ロンロン","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":2}}